        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">How We Chose These Supplies</h2>
        <p>
          We didn't pick products based on which brand advertises the most or pays the highest affiliate commission. Each supply on this list earned its spot by clearing four bars: it needs to solve a specific, common basement water problem rather than a rare edge case; it needs a track record of genuine reliability rather than a flashy feature list; it needs to be realistically DIY-installable by a homeowner with basic tools, since this is a supplies checklist for people doing the work themselves, not a contractor's shopping list; and it needs to be priced proportionately to the problem it solves, since we're just as skeptical of an overpriced product for a simple job as we are of a cheap product that won't hold up.
        </p>
        <p>
          We also deliberately organized this list by function rather than ranking eight unrelated products against each other on a single scale, because a sump pump and a vapor barrier aren't competing for the same purchase decision — comparing them head to head the way we'd compare seven brands of the same product would produce a meaningless ranking. Instead, think of this page as a curated shopping list assembled by someone who has actually worked through a basement waterproofing project: the specific brand and model we'd reach for in each category, based on what holds up in practice rather than what looks impressive in a store display.
        </p>
        <p>
          Where a category deserved a deeper, brand-by-brand comparison — like the full range of masonry waterproofing coatings on the market — we linked out to our dedicated review instead of trying to cram seven more products onto an already-long page. This page is meant to answer "what do I actually need to buy," not to be the exhaustive last word on every category; use it as the starting checklist and follow the links to the deeper reviews for any single item where you want to compare more options before you buy.
